Jumping boots are the only thing in there you want--as an
archaeologist, you want to #twoweapon.  SDSM + CoMR + "oLS or GDSM +
"oReflection + Robe are my optimal setups (usually I like "oESP but
for an arch it's not needed).

The GoPower will destroy your spellcasting ability, and archs are
generally good casters.  Not worth the +3 damage IMO, especially for a
class that can't machine-gun thrown weapons.

> These are important enough to wish for before you start digging for
> the castle.

]oReflection I would absolutely throw out as soon as I found the
amulet, even if I'd just found it laying around.  GoPower I'd throw
out somewhere around there, but it's nice for a while (until you have
any spells).  I'd wear them early, but not worth a wish.

> You should also obtain a elvin cloak soon, and prepare to switch to it
> when needed.

Or a robe/CoMR/etc.  Anything MC3--but elven cloak is likely the
easiest to come by (unless you have a good way of taking out a
priest).

